# Normalize line endings across platforms.
#
# Without this, Windows checkouts (git core.autocrlf=true) get CRLF while
# Prettier expects LF, so `npm run format:check` fails on every file. Forcing
# LF in the working tree on all platforms keeps the formatter, ESLint and CI
# in agreement no matter who clones the repo.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
